      {
        "id": "sc_note_b",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          560,
          600
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## B \u00b7 A form with one Apply button\n\n**Regions**, **Period** and **Min units** have *Behaviour \u25b8 Apply changes* set to **with an Apply button**: change them and an amber dot shows the change is waiting; nothing runs. **Apply** sends all three at once \u2014 one run. **Reset** puts them back.\n\nThey reach **Rows the form keeps** with no wires, as variables:\n\n```\nregion in ${regions} and month >= '${period_start}'\nand month <= '${period_end}' and units >= ${min_units}\n```\n\nRegions takes its chips from the Sales table's region column; Period's calendar is pinned to the months the data covers.",
          "width": 560,
          "height": 0
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null,
        "description": "",
        "active": true,
        "locked": false,
        "frozen": false,
        "manual": false,
