      {
        "id": "sc_note_c",
        "type": "flograph.util.note",
        "pos": [
          2220,
          0
        ],
        "params": {
          "text": "## C \u00b7 Every other control\n\nEach one is wired into **What each control sends**, whose table shows the exact value and type that reaches the flow. Things to try:\n\n- **Product code** is *Required* with a *Pattern* \u2014 empty it or type `ab12` and it turns red, and the readout stops with your message.\n- **Report from** *starts on* the start of this month; pick a day, then press its **\u21ba** to go back to the moving date.\n- **Budget** shows a thousands separator; the flow still gets a bare number.\n- **Highlight** has preset swatches; the big swatch opens the picker.\n- **Sizes** is set so that nothing ticked sends `[]`.",
          "width": 520,
          "height": 0
        },
        "code": null,
        "label": null,
        "description": "",
        "active": true,
        "locked": false,
        "frozen": false,
        "manual": false,
